<title>THAILAND: Thai stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand was closed on Tuesday for a public holiday on New Year's Eve.</p>
<p>The SET index finished the last trading day of the year at a near 43-month low on Monday, dropping 4.14 points to close at 831.57 on 4.7 billion baht turnover.</p>
<p>The key index tumbled 35.07 percent since the beginning of 1996.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Thursday, January 2.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
